{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55639","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 三十七 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 三十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"息业怡神道最孤，藏名匿迹合良图。\n冥心难使龙神见，出语须教海岳枯。\n云驻庵前疑有意，鸟鸣庭际似相呼。\n资持随分安排了，最急应须与道俱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55639.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55639","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}